# Frozen reel overlay rules

Do not loosen, delete, or bypass these without an explicit product decision.

- `headline`: one finished Ukrainian sentence, 6–11 words, with subject, predicate, and required object.
- `detailText`: exactly one finished Ukrainian sentence, 8–12 words. Never two sentences, a paragraph, or a five-word stub.
- `spokenText`: one finished Ukrainian sentence. Never end on a comma, conjunction, or verb without its object (`а тепер ріже.`, `ще один шанс`).
- A trailing period does not make a dangling clause finished.
- Never slice overlay copy by character/word cap. Replace from `spokenText` or fail the run.
- Upper 25% layout, locked dark readability band, no in-video CTA, one shot per digest block, Ukrainian on-screen/voice (brands may stay Latin).

Enforced in `news-digest-pipeline/production/lib/reel-ukrainian-copy.js`. Contract: `news-digest-pipeline/docs/reel-image-workflow.md`.
